cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use NeuraDock EEG 101 in teaching, research, a report, or a publication,
  please cite the software and identify NeuraDock. Usage terms are in LICENSE.md.
title: NeuraDock EEG 101
type: software
authors:
  - name: NeuraDock
    email: business@neuradock.com
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A five-lesson tutorial covering spike-to-signal simulation, real NeuraDock
  recording inspection, signal-quality gating, Alpha-power features, and a
  guided handoff to the NeuraDock EEG Workstation Agent.
keywords:
  - EEG
  - brain-computer interface
  - neuroscience education
  - signal processing
  - NeuraDock
